weet tooth  because i have such a major major sweet  tooth i  always want dessert i always want  something sweet after a meal so if you  learn one thing from this video  freeze your grapes so  true if you haven't frozen grapes you  are missing out and if you want to  really take it to the next level i've  got a recipe in the mindful glow  cookbook where i  soak my grapes in riesling wine  and then i freeze them so lucy my girl  give that a little try when you're  feeling like you need a little  pick-me-up  during the week it will not disappoint  what can we say  about lucy's diet honestly this is  probably one of my favorite harper's  bizarre diet recalls  yet i think we saw a really nice range  of meals and snacks that felt  interesting balanced and non-restrictive  there were some stereotypical  wellness-like foods like greek yogurt  bars  kale salads and hummus we had some fun  foods like chocolate chip pancakes and  bold nazi sauce  and also some inherently balanced yet  not diety dishes  like pho and turkey sandwiches i get the  sense that  lucy isn't afraid of food as i i didn't  hear a lot of diet culture rhetoric  and she describes food with a sense of  gusto  and pleasure she also describes a number  of really healthy self-care activities  that  don't feel restrictive or punishing at  all and she likes true crime so  i can forgive her for the whole cheat  day faux pas  no but seriously all in all i am  definitely filing this one under  reasonable celebrity diets and let me  tell you  it's so far a pretty empty file but on  that note that's all that i have for you  guys today  thank you again to squarespace for  sponsoring this video if you liked it be  sure to give it the thumbs up  leave me a comment below with who you  want to see me review next subscribe to  the channel  and i'll see you next time on abby's  kitchen bye
 

